guide.s2.body:
Icala linezingxenye ezimbili, njengefomu lecala.

Lokho okubonwa yibo bonke abameli abaqinisekisiwe, ngaphandle kwegama lakho:
• umkhakha wokusebenza, okungukuthi icala limayelana nani;
• isihloko nesifinyezo;
• izifundazwe nedolobha;
• isabelomali nokuphuthuma;
• isithombe sekhava sekhadi;
• ukuthi icala linezithombe namafayela amangaki nokuthi linemininingwane yini, kodwa hhayi izithombe, amafayela noma imininingwane uqobo.

Le ngxenye isiza abameli ukuthi bathole icala lakho futhi bathumele isiphakamiso. Ngakho-ke ungafaki iphasipoti, i-SSN, izinombolo ze-akhawunti, amagama, amakheli noma imininingwane yokuxhumana esihlokweni noma esifinyezweni.

Lokho okubonwa kuphela ngummeli owamukela isiphakamiso sakhe:
• imininingwane: indaba ephelele, amagama ezinhlangothi, inombolo yecala, amakheli, izinsuku;
• izithombe namafayela ecala;
• igama lakho nesithombe sephrofayela;
• imininingwane yakho yokuxhumana, uma ummeli enokubhalisa okusebenzayo.
Le ngxenye ivuleka kuphela ngemva kokuba wamukele isiphakamiso. Abasizi balowo mmeli abanokufinyelela emacaleni noma ezingxoxweni nabo bayayibona.

Amazwana ecala abonakala kuwo wonke umuntu obona icala, futhi uhlala ungaziwa kuwo. Ukuthi abameli bayabona yini ukuthi uku-inthanethi kuncike kumasethingi akho obumfihlo.

Uma wamukela isiphakamiso, ezinye iziphakamiso zenqatshwa ngokuzenzakalela futhi labo bameli bayaziswa.

Uma uvimbe ummeli noma yena ekuvimbile, akakwazi ukubona icala lakho. Icala elimisiwe liphuma ku-feed nasekusesheni kwabameli.
